  "details": "I’ve noticed an issue with the Avatar Culling feature in VRChat. Despite setting the Avatar Culling to “Hide Beyond 3m”, it appears that only the player’s mesh is hidden, while the audio and real-time lights remain unaffected.\n\nTo show this problem, I’ve created a short video which you can view here:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ks1t4HzWlC8\n\nI used this avatar to test the issue:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_6824e6de-e2d6-464f-b31c-b114db67d80d",
